msgstr "Chemin historique dont les positions consignent les changements de cette case, sans ordre causal entre cases."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slotHistory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The record names gmeow:slotHistory explicitly."
msgstr "Le relevé nomme explicitement gmeow:slotHistory."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slotPointer|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
